{"id":"tongsci2.2-2-3.1.devices","unit":"tongsci2.2-2-3","html":"<!-- 2. 해 보기 · 우리 주변의 에너지 전환 -->\n<section id=\"tongsci2-2-2-3-1-devices\" data-state=\"devices\" class=\"std\">\n  <div class=\"sheet\"></div>\n  <div class=\"frame\">\n    <div class=\"head split\">\n      <div class=\"titles\">\n        <div data-edit=\"eyebrow\" class=\"eyebrow\">체험 · 교과서 109쪽 해 보기 · 우리 주변의 에너지 전환</div>\n        <h2 data-edit=\"h2\">켜면 에너지는 무엇으로 바뀔까?</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p data-edit=\"pen\" class=\"pen\">켜 보고 → 카드를 끌어다 놓기</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dv-body\" data-prevent-swipe>\n      <div class=\"dv-row\">\n        <div class=\"dv-card\" data-dev=\"tv\" data-name=\"텔레비전\" data-in=\"elec\" data-out=\"light sound heat\">\n          <div class=\"dv-top\"><b>텔레비전</b><button class=\"btn dv-pow\" type=\"button\" id=\"dv-pow-tv\" aria-pressed=\"false\">전원 켜기</button></div>\n          <div class=\"dv-stage\">\n            <svg class=\"dv-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <defs>\n                <radialGradient id=\"dv-tvglow\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#d7ecff\" stop-opacity=\".9\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d7ecff\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></radialGradient>\n                <linearGradient id=\"dv-tvsky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#6fb3e6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d4ecfa\"/></linearGradient>\n                <clipPath id=\"dv-tvclip\"><rect x=\"92\" y=\"34\" width=\"336\" height=\"186\" rx=\"4\"/></clipPath>\n              </defs>\n              <ellipse class=\"dv-glow\" cx=\"260\" cy=\"128\" rx=\"250\" ry=\"150\" fill=\"url(#dv-tvglow)\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-wall\" x=\"10\" y=\"214\" width=\"46\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\"/><circle class=\"dv-hole\" cx=\"26\" cy=\"236\" r=\"4\"/><circle class=\"dv-hole\" cx=\"40\" cy=\"236\" r=\"4\"/>\n              <path class=\"dv-cord\" d=\"M33 262 C 33 296, 130 296, 168 280 S 236 272, 248 256\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-plug\" x=\"20\" y=\"244\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/>\n              <path class=\"dv-stand\" d=\"M234 238 h 52 l 14 30 h -80 z\"/><rect class=\"dv-stand\" x=\"196\" y=\"266\" width=\"128\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-tvbody\" x=\"76\" y=\"18\" width=\"368\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-screen\" x=\"92\" y=\"34\" width=\"336\" height=\"186\" rx=\"4\"/>\n              <g class=\"dv-show\" clip-path=\"url(#dv-tvclip)\">\n                <rect x=\"92\" y=\"34\" width=\"336\" height=\"186\" fill=\"url(#dv-tvsky)\"/>\n                <circle class=\"dv-tvsun\" cx=\"160\" cy=\"88\" r=\"20\"/>\n                <path class=\"dv-tvcloud\" d=\"M250 80 q 10 -18 30 -10 q 12 -16 32 -4 q 20 0 16 16 z\"/>\n                <path class=\"dv-hill1\" d=\"M92 190 Q 170 130 250 180 T 428 160 V 220 H 92 Z\"/>\n                <path class=\"dv-hill2\" d=\"M92 205 Q 210 168 320 200 T 428 196 V 220 H 92 Z\"/>\n                <g class=\"dv-bird\"><path d=\"M0 0 q 7 -7 14 0 q 7 -7 14 0\"/></g>\n              </g>\n              <circle class=\"dv-led\" cx=\"426\" cy=\"229\" r=\"4\"/>\n              <g class=\"dv-waves dv-wl\"><path d=\"M64 110 q -18 18 0 36\"/><path d=\"M48 98 q -26 30 0 60\"/></g>\n              <g class=\"dv-waves dv-wr\"><path d=\"M456 110 q 18 18 0 36\"/><path d=\"M472 98 q 26 30 0 60\"/></g>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dv-heat\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .95\" cx=\"260\" cy=\"40\" rx=\"170\" ry=\"44\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .75\" cx=\"260\" cy=\"128\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"100\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .5\" cx=\"248\" cy=\"250\" rx=\"34\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dv-eq\">\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">들어가는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"in\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"텔레비전에 들어가는 에너지 칸\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">나오는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"텔레비전에서 나오는 에너지 칸 1\"></div><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"텔레비전에서 나오는 에너지 칸 2\"></div><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"텔레비전에서 나오는 에너지 칸 3\"></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"dv-card\" data-dev=\"spk\" data-name=\"스피커\" data-in=\"elec\" data-out=\"sound heat\">\n          <div class=\"dv-top\"><b>스피커</b><button class=\"btn dv-pow\" type=\"button\" id=\"dv-pow-spk\" aria-pressed=\"false\">음악 틀기</button></div>\n          <div class=\"dv-stage\">\n            <svg class=\"dv-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect class=\"dv-wall\" x=\"10\" y=\"214\" width=\"46\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\"/><circle class=\"dv-hole\" cx=\"26\" cy=\"236\" r=\"4\"/><circle class=\"dv-hole\" cx=\"40\" cy=\"236\" r=\"4\"/>\n              <path class=\"dv-cord\" d=\"M33 262 C 33 296, 120 296, 160 270\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-plug\" x=\"20\" y=\"244\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-cab\" x=\"150\" y=\"14\" width=\"180\" height=\"272\" rx=\"12\"/>\n              <circle class=\"dv-ring\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"72\" r=\"28\"/><circle class=\"dv-cap\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"72\" r=\"12\"/>\n              <g class=\"dv-woof\"><circle class=\"dv-ring\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"188\" r=\"76\"/><circle class=\"dv-cone\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"188\" r=\"62\"/><circle class=\"dv-cone2\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"188\" r=\"44\"/><circle class=\"dv-cap\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"188\" r=\"22\"/></g>\n              <g class=\"dv-waves dv-wr\"><path d=\"M346 160 q 22 28 0 56\"/><path d=\"M370 140 q 34 48 0 96\"/><path d=\"M394 120 q 46 68 0 136\"/></g>\n              <g class=\"dv-notes\"><text x=\"400\" y=\"80\">♪</text><text x=\"438\" y=\"120\">♫</text></g>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dv-heat\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <circle class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .85\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"188\" r=\"70\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .7\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"272\" rx=\"88\" ry=\"28\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <circle class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .4\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"72\" r=\"30\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dv-eq\">\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">들어가는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"in\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"스피커에 들어가는 에너지 칸\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">나오는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"스피커에서 나오는 에너지 칸 1\"></div><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"스피커에서 나오는 에너지 칸 2\"></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"dv-card\" data-dev=\"candle\" data-name=\"촛불\" data-in=\"chem\" data-out=\"light heat\">\n          <div class=\"dv-top\"><b>촛불</b><button class=\"btn dv-pow\" type=\"button\" id=\"dv-pow-candle\" aria-pressed=\"false\">불 붙이기</button></div>\n          <div class=\"dv-stage\">\n            <svg class=\"dv-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <defs><radialGradient id=\"dv-candleglow\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffe9a8\" stop-opacity=\".95\"/><stop offset=\".5\" stop-color=\"#ffd36b\" stop-opacity=\".35\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffd36b\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></radialGradient></defs>\n              <circle class=\"dv-glow\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"100\" r=\"190\" fill=\"url(#dv-candleglow)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"dv-dish\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"280\" rx=\"120\" ry=\"16\"/>\n              <rect class=\"dv-wax\" x=\"204\" y=\"136\" width=\"72\" height=\"146\" rx=\"6\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"dv-pool\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"136\" rx=\"36\" ry=\"8\"/>\n              <path class=\"dv-drip\" d=\"M214 138 v 28 a 5 5 0 0 0 10 0 v -24\"/>\n              <path class=\"dv-wick\" d=\"M240 136 v -16\"/>\n              <g class=\"dv-flame\">\n                <path class=\"dv-fo\" d=\"M240 40 C 264 70, 268 98, 240 120 C 212 98, 216 70, 240 40 Z\"/>\n                <path class=\"dv-fi\" d=\"M240 70 C 252 86, 252 104, 240 116 C 228 104, 228 86, 240 70 Z\"/>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"dv-hwaves\"><path d=\"M214 30 c -10 -12 10 -18 0 -30\"/><path d=\"M240 24 c -10 -12 10 -18 0 -30\"/><path d=\"M266 30 c -10 -12 10 -18 0 -30\"/></g>\n              <text class=\"dv-cap-t\" x=\"240\" y=\"222\">파라핀</text>\n            </svg>\n            <svg class=\"dv-heat\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 300\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: 1\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"92\" rx=\"56\" ry=\"70\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .8\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"24\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"50\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n              <ellipse class=\"hb\" style=\"--o: .45\" cx=\"240\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"46\" ry=\"26\" fill=\"url(#dv-hot)\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dv-eq\">\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">들어가는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"in\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"촛불에 들어가는 에너지 칸\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"dv-line\"><span class=\"dv-lab\">나오는</span><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"촛불에서 나오는 에너지 칸 1\"></div><div class=\"slot\" data-slot=\"out\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"촛불에서 나오는 에너지 칸 2\"></div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <svg class=\"dv-defs\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><radialGradient id=\"dv-hot\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffffff\"/><stop offset=\".22\" stop-color=\"#fff07a\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#ff9a1f\"/><stop offset=\".7\" stop-color=\"#e0245e\" stop-opacity=\".8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#6a1b9a\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></radialGradient></defs></svg>\n      <div class=\"dv-tray tray\">\n        <span class=\"tray-tag\">에너지 카드</span>\n        <div class=\"dv-chips\" aria-label=\"에너지 카드(끌어다 칸에 놓기)\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"elec\" style=\"--c: var(--e-elec)\">전기 에너지</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"chem\" style=\"--c: var(--e-chem)\">화학 에너지</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"light\" style=\"--c: var(--e-light)\">빛에너지</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"sound\" style=\"--c: var(--e-sound)\">소리 에너지</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"heat\" style=\"--c: var(--e-heat)\">열에너지</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"dv-chip tray-item\" data-e=\"kin\" style=\"--c: var(--e-kin)\">운동 에너지</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dv-acts tray-end\">\n          <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"dv-all\">정답 보기</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p data-edit=\"dv-msg\" class=\"dv-msg pen\" aria-live=\"polite\">기구를 켜 보고, 에너지 카드를 알맞은 칸에 끌어다 놓아 보자</p>\n      <div class=\"dv-cam\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"열화상 카메라(끌어서 기구에 비추기, 화살표 키로도 움직임)\">\n        <span class=\"dv-cam-ring\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dv-cam-grip\"><b>열화상 카메라</b><span class=\"dv-scale\">차가움<i></i>뜨거움</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footer\"><b>교과서 109쪽 해 보기</b><span>쓰려는 에너지와 함께 버려지는 에너지도 나온다</span></div>\n  <aside class=\"notes\">\n해 보기 · 우리 주변의 에너지 전환 (8분)\n- 기구마다 단추로 켠다: 텔레비전(화면·소리), 스피커(콘이 떨리고 소리), 촛불(불꽃).\n- 아래 카드를 끌어다(또는 카드 → 칸 차례로 눌러) 들어가는 에너지·나오는 에너지 칸에 놓는다. 틀리면 칸이 흔들리고 힌트가 뜬다. 카드는 몇 번이든 다시 쓸 수 있다.\n- 빛·소리만 넣고 멈추는 학생이 많다 → 처음부터 촛불 칸 위에 떠 있는 «열화상 카메라»를 끌어다 기구에 비추면 렌즈 안만 열화상으로 보인다. 켜 둔 기구는 서서히 달아오르고, 꺼진 기구는 차갑다. 열에너지 칸을 채우게 한다.\n- 예시 답: 텔레비전 전기 → 빛·소리·열, 스피커 전기 → 소리·열, 촛불 화학 → 빛·열. «정답 보기»로 모두 채운다.\n- 지도 방안: 에너지 전환은 다음에 배울 보존·효율의 디딤돌. 쓰려는 에너지 말고도 열처럼 버려지는 에너지가 함께 나온다는 것을 꼭 짚는다.\n  </aside>\n</section>","css":"\n","js":"/* tongsci2.2-2-3.1.devices */\n(function () {\n  'use strict';\n  const { part } = window.Deck;\n  const J = (...p) => window.RxT.join(...p);\n  // 한 묶음에서 하나만 누르게(다시 누르면 풀림)\n  const single = (btns) => btns.forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const on = b.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true';\n    btns.forEach((x) => x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on && x === b)));\n  }));\n  const dock = (root, cfg) => window.UDock.mount(root, cfg);\n  part('tongsci2-2-2-3-1-devices', (root) => J(window.DevicesLab.mount(root), dock(root, {\n    steps: ['기구 켜기', '카드 놓기', '열화상 카메라 비추기'],\n    on: ['.dv-pow', (r) => r.querySelector('.slot.on'), '.dv-cam'],\n    learn: '기구는 쓰려는 에너지(빛·소리)와 함께 <b>열에너지</b>도 내놓는다. 카메라를 대야 보이는 몫이다.',\n  })));\n})();\n","needs":["drag","devices"],"media":{}}